## Setting defaults

Unless a default value is set for an argument, R will require a value to be specified in the function call


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
std_compact <- standardize(unscaled_cancer$Compactness)
```
:::


```
 Error in mean(x, na.rm = na.rm) : 
