```

## Setting defaults

To set a default, set the value in the function definition



::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
standardize <- function(x, na.rm = TRUE) { 
  (x - mean(x, na.rm = na.rm)) / sd(x, na.rm = na.rm)
}
```
:::



::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
std_compact <- standardize(unscaled_cancer$Compactness)
```
