## Conditional execution

The `if()` statement allows us to control which statements are executed.


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
if(condition) {
  # commands when TRUE
}
```
:::




::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
if(condition) {
  # commands when TRUE
} else {
  # commands when FALSE
}
```
:::


